# kind | name | source (on-disk LICENSE path for shards; for clib/runtime, an
# SPDX id of licenses-spdx/, or the path of the library's own license file)
#
# Only what the released binary actually embeds: the runtime shards of
# shard.yml (spectator is a development dependency that never ends up in it),
# and the C libraries the binary links. Add a line for every runtime shard
# added. Assembled into licenses/ (baked into the binary, printed by
# `ssherlock licenses`) by scripts/harvest-licenses.sh.
#
# CONFIRMED on 2026-11-18 against the link line of this very binary, in
# alpine:3.24 with Alpine's crystal 1.20.3 (the base of the image
# crystalreleaser generates for the linux builds, plus libssh2):
#   -lssh2 -lssl -lcrypto -lz -lyaml -lpcre2-8 -pthread -lgc -ldl
#   (+ musl, libgcc)
# libssh2 comes from the ssh2 shard. Versions and licenses as apk records them
# in that image: libssh2 1.11.1 BSD-3-Clause, openssl 3.5.9 Apache-2.0, yaml
# 0.2.5 MIT, pcre2 10.49 BSD-3-Clause, zlib 1.4 Zlib, musl 1.2.6 MIT, gc 8.2.12
# Boehm-GC. The darwin binaries link Homebrew's openssl@4 (4.1.0, Apache-2.0)
# and libssh2 (1.11.1, BSD-3-Clause) statically, and libgc, pcre2 and libyaml
# from the compiler mise installs; zlib and libiconv come from macOS itself.
# They embed the same notices, musl and libgcc included, which they do not
# link. Check the link line again when a stdlib module or a C binding is
# added, or the image moves.
#
# MIT, BSD-3-Clause and zlib require the copyright notice to be reproduced,
# and their SPDX text only has a blank there: those libraries embed their own
# license file, taken from their sources at the versions above:
#   libssh2  COPYING     github.com/libssh2/libssh2     tag libssh2-1.11.1
#   libyaml  License     github.com/yaml/libyaml        tag 0.2.5
#   pcre2    LICENCE.md  github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2  tag pcre2-10.49
#   zlib     LICENSE     github.com/madler/zlib         tag v1.4
#   musl     COPYRIGHT   git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl    tag v1.2.6
shard   | ssh2              | lib/ssh2/LICENSE
shard   | admiral           | lib/admiral/LICENSE
shard   | baked_file_system | lib/baked_file_system/LICENSE
shard   | crystal-env       | lib/crystal-env/LICENSE
clib    | libssh2           | licenses-upstream/libssh2.txt
clib    | openssl           | Apache-2.0
clib    | libyaml           | licenses-upstream/libyaml.txt
clib    | pcre2             | licenses-upstream/pcre2.txt
clib    | zlib              | licenses-upstream/zlib.txt
clib    | boehm-gc          | Boehm-GC
clib    | musl              | licenses-upstream/musl.txt
clib    | libgcc            | GCC-runtime-exception
runtime | crystal           | Apache-2.0
project | ssherlock         | LICENSE
